                    "pages": [
                        {
                            "key": "imprint",
                            "name": "Imprint",
                            "content": "<h2>Imprint</h2><p><strong>Demo placeholder — replace with your real legal notice before going live.</strong></p><p>FIB Booking Demo Operator<br>Demo Street 1<br>00000 Demo City</p><p>Represented by: The Demo Operator<br>Contact: hello@example.invalid</p>"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "privacy",
                            "name": "Privacy Policy",
                            "content": "<h2>Privacy Policy</h2><p><strong>Demo placeholder — replace with your real privacy policy before going live.</strong></p><p>This demo shop processes personal data for ticket purchases (name, e-mail, address), ticket fulfilment (QR scan logs with configurable retention and anonymization) and the customer-to-customer resale market (listing and settlement data). Scan logs store only a token fingerprint, never the scan credential itself.</p>"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "terms",
                            "name": "Terms & Conditions",
                            "content": "<h2>Terms &amp; Conditions</h2><p><strong>Demo placeholder — replace with your real terms before going live.</strong></p><p>Tickets are personal entitlements represented by a QR code. Reselling is only available between private customers through the integrated resale market; the platform charges no fee on resales. A resold ticket is re-issued with a fresh QR code — the seller's copy becomes invalid at the moment of sale.</p>"
                        },
                        {
                            "key": "withdrawal",
                            "name": "Right of Withdrawal",
                            "content": "<h2>Right of Withdrawal</h2><p><strong>Demo placeholder — replace with your real withdrawal policy before going live.</strong></p><p>Note for ticket shops: leisure-event tickets for a specific date are commonly exempt from the statutory right of withdrawal (e.g. § 312g (2) No. 9 BGB) — verify with your legal counsel which of your products are affected.</p>"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        "service": {
            "rootName": "Demo Service",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "key": "how-it-works",
                    "name": "How Booking Works",
                    "content": "<h2>How booking works</h2><ol><li>Pick a date and time in the calendar — the seat or capacity is held for you for a short time.</li><li>Check out as usual; payment confirms the booking.</li><li>You receive your ticket as a QR code: by e-mail (PDF), in your account area, and as an Apple/Google Wallet pass.</li><li>At the entrance the QR code is scanned — multi-entry passes can check in and out as often as their validity allows.</li><li>Plans changed? Offer your ticket on the resale market: another customer buys it, you get the full price — the old QR code is invalidated automatically.</li></ol>"
                },
                {
                    "key": "faq",
                    "name": "FAQ",
                    "content": "<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Where do I find my tickets?</h3><p>In your account under “My tickets” — including wallet downloads.</p><h3>Can I resell my ticket?</h3><p>Yes — list it from your account at a price of your choice. The sale is private customer-to-customer; the platform charges no fee. After the sale the buyer receives a fresh QR code and your copy stops working.</p><h3>What if I scanned my ticket already?</h3><p>Used tickets cannot be listed, and listing a ticket and then using it cancels the listing automatically.</p><h3>How long are passes valid?</h3><p>Day passes 24h from first use, monthly passes one month from purchase, annual passes one year from your chosen start date.</p>"
                },
                {
                    "key": "contact",
                    "name": "Contact",
                    "content": "<h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about a booking? Include your booking number (starts with “B-”) or ticket number and we will get back to you.</p>",
                    "contactForm": true
                }
            ]
